-I. I NTRODUCTION
-Analog circuit schematics encode functional information
-(component types, values, and topological connections) in a
-visual format designed for human interpretation. Converting
-scanned schematics into machine-readable SPICE (Simulation
-Program with Integrated Circuit Emphasis) netlists enables
