-We report join F1 as the component-connectivity F1 score,
-measuring which pairs of components share a net in the
-predicted versus ground-truth netlist. We report simulation
-accuracy as the percentage of random seeds for which every
-source current in the predicted SPICE netlist matches the clean
-oracle within 5%.
